  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-website-summary-8b2d2d6a-fd7b-4dc4-a995-0bdf83bde6b7",
        "text": "We started by building Fayea's website with **HTML**! We used tags like `<h1>` for her title, `<p>` for paragraphs, and even added a cool picture with the `<img>` tag.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2193c6ef8714b570e5481d328fb16a92-agathaweb-website-summary-panel-1-f625785a-ea16-47bb-a3fc-8a17b91e856f.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-website-summary-20dd3c37-5230-4f94-9eec-d3c7957228c3",
        "text": "But a basic website can be a bit plain. That's when we added **CSS** to make it look awesome! CSS let us pick colors and choose cool fonts to match Fayea's style.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3b448c09e0709a23d92115880c9a9384-agathaweb-website-summary-panel-2-08d56275-1543-42b3-a5f2-b02f2b887ed7.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-website-summary-eedeecff-6b56-4c7a-89ac-887df29353fa",
        "text": "See how much better Fayea's self-defense website looks now? You helped her create a fantastic online home, all thanks to HTML for structure and CSS for style!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c053d1cb2d13bb4c603fcecf5090f9d1-agathaweb-website-summary-panel-3-6d0c6767-86d2-4acd-8c1f-5d24fa9507c0.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-website-summary-02fbc7f5-8954-4d99-ad93-63f7e64da7ff",
        "text": "You've learned the basics of web building! Imagine all the other amazing things you could add, like more lessons, videos, or even a way for visitors to contact Fayea!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/1a20a7d236df14591c7222b10b6732d9-agathaweb-website-summary-panel-4-64a8569a-9bd6-4f11-aac3-9e4a7d4e5f19.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Summarize what the student has learned about building a simple website for Fayea, combining HTML for structure and CSS for style. Congratulate them on helping Fayea create her online presence and encourage them to think about future additions."
  },
